<title>POLAND: DROSED NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 32.000.</title>
<headline>DROSED NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 32.000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.03 vs   0.48</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.07 vs   0.72</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.16 vs   0.72</p>
<p> Sales		   14.06 vs   8.44</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.73 vs   5.96</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.59 vs   8.18</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.12 vs   7.27</p>
<p> Sales		  129.96 vs  84.48</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish poultry producer is Drosed</p>
<p>Siedleckie Zaklady Drobiarskie SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
